OL,5,G1500 Columbo: An Exercise in Fatality
OL,6,     FDetective drama starring Peter
OL,7,     FFalk and Robert Conrad. Lieutenant
OL,8,     FColumbo investigates fraud and
OL,9,     Fmurder involving a shady health
OL,10,     Fclub salesman. (1974)
